    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/8bfa725f6a255fcf56ea5a9b519d1618.webp?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Relaxing and Welcoming Community MMORPG Enjoy your adventure in &quot;TeeTINY Online&quot; with &quot;Smart Tower Life&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in a world trapped in time and space, and uncover the secrets of the tower alongside friends from all over the world. Experience the joy of breaking barriers, communicating, and collaborating with others in this shared adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/e8c16fa1ce773ef0e482bc5eb5baa225.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more server selections. With a single, unified server, you can meet players from around the globe! Wherever you are, you can find new friends. (\\*Service coverage is continuously expanding.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/ec51be67d1c7760d78978512c3875604.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind complex controls. Enjoy an easy, comfortable gameplay experience that lets you relax, explore, and embark on adventures without hassle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3cae1ccdeecd166707bfff13adbfd031.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/3005482db4c61547f2d8c8e0afe421ae.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself through your avatar! There are no class restrictions\u2014create your unique character with different weapons and outfits that reflect your personality.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/a1778618520bf63038fb29ff717fc345.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/a1778618520bf63038fb29ff717fc345.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/a1778618520bf63038fb29ff717fc345.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/7633a07575c0cab3f9da86f386def5b4.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pet system where every monster can become your summon! Tame your favorite monsters, use them as your companions, and enjoy the adventure with your very own summons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/877274037669ea819744d6de995cf6b3.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/877274037669ea819744d6de995cf6b3.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/877274037669ea819744d6de995cf6b3.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/587b0c0a7be7bae1eee494d4204c63e2.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to craft various items and prepare delicious meals. Enhance your character's abilities with crafted items and special dishes, and enjoy the sense of satisfaction from creating with your own hands.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/b0b07659fb198e556481e871bdd182f4.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/b0b07659fb198e556481e871bdd182f4.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/b0b07659fb198e556481e871bdd182f4.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/eecb0844a98ea11048b618f1fcf4388f.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and decorate your own home! Use a wide variety of furniture and decorations to create a cozy, personalized space, and invite friends to visit. Relax in a space that you've made just for you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/f376dfe4d0367969d8be4815dff8aa03.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/f376dfe4d0367969d8be4815dff8aa03.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/f376dfe4d0367969d8be4815dff8aa03.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/1e4178dc717730e04d2d57c1e0fdfe15.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with friends as you play a variety of mini-games at the retro arcade! Regular game tournaments will keep the excitement going, offering even more thrilling competition.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/93cb3d32813a6c0c68565f21f01c8f96.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/93cb3d32813a6c0c68565f21f01c8f96.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/93cb3d32813a6c0c68565f21f01c8f96.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/9d1285b7527422fd9b10d33196ea4bb8.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No high-end PC needed. If you have a PC with Windows 10, you're ready for &quot;Smart Tower Life.&quot; Enjoy optimal immersion with carefully crafted effects that ensure a comfortable gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enjoy a relaxed community and thrilling adventure in &quot;TeeTINY Online: Smart Tower Life&quot;. Start your journey today!</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/8bfa725f6a255fcf56ea5a9b519d1618.webp?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Relaxing and Welcoming Community MMORPG Enjoy your adventure in &quot;TeeTINY Online&quot; with &quot;Smart Tower Life&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in a world trapped in time and space, and uncover the secrets of the tower alongside friends from all over the world. Experience the joy of breaking barriers, communicating, and collaborating with others in this shared adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/e8c16fa1ce773ef0e482bc5eb5baa225.webp?t=1742821173\" width=800 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more server selections. With a single, unified server, you can meet players from around the globe! Wherever you are, you can find new friends. (\\*Service coverage is continuously expanding.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.poster.avif?t=1742821173\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.webm?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/6291c09b8af3db621a478d72943da54a.mp4?t=1742821173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301040/extras/ec51be67d1c7760d78978512c387